    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d453">

                <pb facs="0461" n="449" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg449"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.00/2566: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador to the Polish Government in Exile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Biddle</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-15T19:00:00+01:00">December 15,
                            1941—7 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 15—2:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Polish Series 54. Polish Government at instance of Allied Governments established
                    in London has again approached me regarding participation in conference
                    described in my 44, November 26, 2 p.m. They now propose holding meeting in late
                        December<anchor n="5" xml:id="d453-f1"/> and express hope that in view of
                    changed international situation American representatives to Allied Governments
                    may take part “in same capacity as the representatives of Great Britain, Soviet
                    Russia and China, i. e., as their guest, not as actual participant.”</p>
                <p>I understand British Government is prepared to be represented but neither U. S.
                    S. R. nor China has yet accepted.</p>
                <pb facs="0462" n="450" xml:id="pg450"/>
                <p>I have indicated doubt as to advisability of our participation but request
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Biddle</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d453-f1" n="5" xml:id="d453-f1-content">
                <p>The date of the meeting was finally fixed for January 13, 1942.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
